backend-docs/
# HG service binary directories under src-tauri only (do NOT match src/huanvaeGuard/* — case-insensitive FS)
src-tauri/resources/HuanvaeGuard/
src-tauri/target/*/HuanvaeGuard/

data/

.tauri/

huanvae-chat-app.jks
huanvae-chat-app.jks.base64

